{
  "description": "Add observed error responses to v2 operations. Discovered via live API probes against api.axiom.co: 404 is returned for unknown resource IDs on all by-ID GET/PUT/DELETE endpoints; 422 is returned for missing/invalid body fields on create/update; 400 is returned for malformed inputs (e.g. invalid dataset name, malformed annotation ID). The spec defines BadRequestError itself; this file adds UnprocessableEntityError, which it does not.",
